{"v":[{"a":["وَٱلَّيۡلِ","إِذَا","يَغۡشَىٰ"],"t":"By the night as it covers","l":"Wa Al-Layli 'Idha Yaghsha","w":[["wa-al-layli","By the night"],["idhā","when"],["yaghshā","it covers"]]},{"a":["وَٱلنَّهَارِ","إِذَا","تَجَلَّىٰ"],"t":"And the day as it reveals","l":"Wa An-Nahari 'Idha Tajalla","w":[["wal-nahāri","And the day"],["idhā","when"],["tajallā","it shines in brightness"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","خَلَقَ","ٱلذَّكَرَ","وَٱلۡأُنثَىٰٓ"],"t":"And He who created the male and the female","l":"Wa Ma Khalaqa Adh-Dhakara Wa Al-'Untha","w":[["wamā","And He Who"],["khalaqa","created"],["l-dhakara","the male"],["wal-unthā","and the female"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","سَعۡيَكُمۡ","لَشَتَّىٰ"],"t":"Your endeavors are indeed diverse","l":"Inna Sa`yakum Lashatta","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["saʿyakum","your efforts"],["lashattā","(are) surely diverse"]]},{"a":["فَأَمَّا","مَنۡ","أَعۡطَىٰ","وَٱتَّقَىٰ"],"t":"As for him who gives and is righteous","l":"Fa'amma Man 'A`ta Wa Attaqa","w":[["fa-ammā","Then as for"],["man","(him) who"],["aʿṭā","gives"],["wa-ittaqā","and fears"]]},{"a":["وَصَدَّقَ","بِٱلۡحُسۡنَىٰ"],"t":"And confirms goodness","l":"Wa Saddaqa Bil-Husna","w":[["waṣaddaqa","And believes"],["bil-ḥus'nā","in the best"]]},{"a":["فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ","لِلۡيُسۡرَىٰ"],"t":"We will ease his way towards ease","l":"Fasanuyassiruhu Lilyusra","w":[["fasanuyassiruhu","Then We will ease him"],["lil'yus'rā","towards [the] ease"]]},{"a":["وَأَمَّا","مَنۢ","بَخِلَ","وَٱسۡتَغۡنَىٰ"],"t":"But as for him who is stingy and complacent","l":"Wa 'Amma Man Bakhila Wa Astaghna","w":[["wa-ammā","But as for"],["man","(him) who"],["bakhila","withholds"],["wa-is'taghnā","and considers himself free from need"]]},{"a":["وَكَذَّبَ","بِٱلۡحُسۡنَىٰ"],"t":"And denies goodness","l":"Wa Kadhaba Bil-Husna","w":[["wakadhaba","And denies"],["bil-ḥus'nā","the best"]]},{"a":["فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ","لِلۡعُسۡرَىٰ"],"t":"We will ease his way towards difficulty","l":"Fasanuyassiruhu Lil`usra","w":[["fasanuyassiruhu","Then We will ease him"],["lil'ʿus'rā","towards [the] difficulty"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","يُغۡنِي","عَنۡهُ","مَالُهُۥٓ","إِذَا","تَرَدَّىٰٓ"],"t":"And his money will not avail him when he plummets","l":"Wa Ma Yughni `Anhu Maluhu 'Idha Taradda","w":[["wamā","And not"],["yugh'nī","will avail"],["ʿanhu","him"],["māluhu","his wealth"],["idhā","when"],["taraddā","he falls"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","عَلَيۡنَا","لَلۡهُدَىٰ"],"t":"It is upon Us to guide","l":"Inna `Alayna Lalhuda","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["ʿalaynā","upon Us"],["lalhudā","(is) the guidance"]]},{"a":["وَإِنَّ","لَنَا","لَلۡأٓخِرَةَ","وَٱلۡأُولَىٰ"],"t":"And to Us belong the Last and the First","l":"Wa 'Inna Lana Lal'akhirata Wa Al-'Ula","w":[["wa-inna","And indeed"],["lanā","for Us"],["lalākhirata","(is) the Hereafter"],["wal-ūlā","and the first (life)"]]},{"a":["فَأَنذَرۡتُكُمۡ","نَارٗا","تَلَظَّىٰ"],"t":"I have warned you of a Fierce Blaze","l":"Fa'andhartukum Naraan Talazza","w":[["fa-andhartukum","So I warn you"],["nāran","(of) a Fire"],["talaẓẓā","blazing"]]},{"a":["لَا","يَصۡلَىٰهَآ","إِلَّا","ٱلۡأَشۡقَى"],"t":"None will burn in it except the very wicked","l":"La Yaslaha 'Illa Al-'Ashqa","w":[["lā","Not"],["yaṣlāhā","will burn (in) it"],["illā","except"],["l-ashqā","the most wretched"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِي","كَذَّبَ","وَتَوَلَّىٰ"],"t":"He who denies and turns away","l":"Al-Ladhi Kadhaba Wa Tawalla","w":[["alladhī","The one who"],["kadhaba","denied"],["watawallā","and turned away"]]},{"a":["وَسَيُجَنَّبُهَا","ٱلۡأَتۡقَى"],"t":"But the devout will avoid it","l":"Wa Sayujannabuha Al-'Atqa","w":[["wasayujannabuhā","But will be removed from it"],["l-atqā","the righteous"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِي","يُؤۡتِي","مَالَهُۥ","يَتَزَكَّىٰ"],"t":"He who gives his money to become pure","l":"Al-Ladhi Yu'uti Malahu Yatazakka","w":[["alladhī","The one who"],["yu'tī","gives"],["mālahu","his wealth"],["yatazakkā","(to) purify himself"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","لِأَحَدٍ","عِندَهُۥ","مِن","نِّعۡمَةٖ","تُجۡزَىٰٓ"],"t":"Seeking no favor in return","l":"Wa Ma Li'hadin `Indahu Min Ni`mat